# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P1, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0. Evan's moves
# (2026-11-13), quickly: Osc/Sb to the sub, the sub to -4 oct, drone I's pitch down to 22 Hz; then the clicks, held.
# "# @" marks the listening times (tools/make_manual.py --times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tapkey w0
tap PLAY
wait 3000
wav ticks.wav
# @ P1 Niagara as it starts: no clicks
wait 1500
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
# @ Osc/Sb to the sub, the sub to -4 oct, drone I's pitch quickly down to 22 Hz
turn K1 70 15
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tap HOME
tap HOME
turn K1 -33 50
# @ Clicks, about 3 a second, ringing in P1's delay and reverb
wait 12000
wavstop
page 5
wait 400
shot ticks-0.png
page 1
wait 400
shot ticks-1.png
